    {
      "contentTypeKey": "394dc214-e2ad-4605-ab3f-2c6b83063ef6",
      "text": "Automatic enrolment questions and answers",
      "udi": "umb://element/e318a2f861c84c61845af5b09f044654"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "e0876897-88f4-4dcf-ae0a-ec5a37e3a185",
      "text": {
        "markup": "<p>Based on the information you've provided you are, or will be, an employer with staff who must be put into a pension scheme. Your automatic enrolment duties start when you employ your first member of staff (duties start date).</p>\n<p>Remember, automatic enrolment is your legal duty and if you don't act in time you could be fined. Use our new duties timeline to help you work out what you need to do and by when. Just enter your duties start date.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
